world Tiny peaceful courtyard garden at twilight; the listener stands at the entrance facing the central circular fountain. Birds perch beyond the far boundary.
  seed 2026
  size 40
  terrain relief 0 roughness 0.05
  ground weathered stone paving weight 1
  ground garden soil weight 0.2 near entrance_hedge 0.4
  strip courtyard_boundary Low stone boundary around the sides and back of the courtyard width 0.5 material rough stone coping and mortared stone flow 0 edge stone paving path -5,0 -5,12 5,12 5,0
  fixture central_fountain Circular stone fountain with a low round basin and a small trickling spout, six metres ahead of the entrance size 2x0.9x2 material carved stone containing water near listener 6 bearing 0
  fixture left_lantern Silent warm lantern on a short post size 0.25x1.2x0.25 material painted metal and glass near listener 3 bearing -60
  fixture right_lantern Silent warm lantern on a short post size 0.25x1.2x0.25 material painted metal and glass near listener 3 bearing 60
  fixture entrance_hedge Low leafy hedge beside the left side of the entrance size 0.7x0.8x3 material small green leaves and woody twigs porous 0.75 near listener 2.7 bearing -60
  fixture back_hedge Low clipped hedge along the back of the garden size 8x0.8x0.7 material small green leaves and woody twigs porous 0.75 near listener 11 bearing 0
  fixture outer_shrub Leafy shrub beyond the far courtyard boundary, holding one stationary songbird size 1.5x2.2x1.5 material green leaves and woody branches porous 0.8 near listener 18 bearing 12
  weather rain 0 wind 0.2 fog 0
  time 18:30 season early autumn temp 16

loop gen A small stone fountain trickling steadily into its basin, gentle flowing water with small rounded splashes, close, dry, no other sources.
  source_id world.fountain_flow
  catalog_ref stream_small
  at central_fountain top
  spl 42
  gen_key fountain_flow_25d06a2a
  visual sphere
loop gen Small hedge leaves lightly rustling in a gentle steady breeze, close, dry, no other sources.
  source_id world.hedge_breeze
  catalog_ref wind_open
  radius 1.5
  at entrance_hedge
  spl 35
  volume follow wind 0to1 0to5
  gen_key hedge_breeze_4d5e5a14
  visual sphere

entity evening_birds
  at outer_shrub top
  active 4.5to10 17to20.5
  quiet rain 0.35 wind 0.65
  spl 75
  visual sphere
  loop gen A songbird giving short relaxed evening calls with generous pauses between phrases, close, dry, no other sources.
    source_id world.evening_birds.evening_calls
    catalog_ref songbird_song
    active 16to21
    quiet rain 0.4 wind 0.6
    gen_key evening_birds_evening_calls_b149b3ac
  oneshot gen A songbird giving individual short contact calls with long pauses, close, dry, no other sources.
    source_id world.evening_birds.morning_calls
    catalog_ref songbird_song
    every 35to70
    quiet rain 0.4 wind 0.6
    gen_key evening_birds_morning_calls_1ec91db4
endentity
